      "type": "Journal article",
      "author": "Cheng, Jinlong, et al.",
      "title": "The S2 Subunit of QX-type Infectious Bronchitis Coronavirus Spike Protein Is an Essential Determinant of Neurotropism",
      "publication": "Viruses",
      "date": "October 22, 2019",
      "url": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6832359/",
